ndlord easy wins\n\nReason: With the Landlord holding only 1 card, this is a critical moment. I must play my highest card (♥Q) to maximize pressure. If the Landlord has an Ace or 2, they\'ll be forced to play it, giving my teammate (with 3 cards) control. If they have a lower card (9, 7, or 6), I win the trick and maintain control. Playing lower cards would give the Landlord an easy path to victory.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥Q"]}'}
